title: "Vesi-Labflow — 药学与生命科学科研工作流引擎"
abstract: "A reproducible, gate-driven research workflow engine for pharmaceutical and life sciences: literature → experimental design → data records → statistics → claim-evidence mapped manuscripts. Includes executable gates, honest degradation paths, and validated domain tools (NCA, compartmental fitting, release modelling, statistics pipeline)."
type: software
